# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# 第 9 批（B6）：補齊條文覆蓋──水污染防治措施計畫及許可申請審查管理辦法（第47至62條）
WP = "ENV-47"
Q = [
(WP,"第47條",3,"水措-廢止計畫核准文件",
 "主管機關得廢止事業水措計畫核准文件之情形為何？",
 ["新設事業已停止設置主要生產設備或經目的事業主管機關認定無繼續設廠（場）事實；事業停工（業）一年以上；事業遷移或主要設備已搬遷經認定無繼續生產事實；改變生產製程致無廢水產生；經下水道管理機關通知拒絕納管自通知日起一個月內仍未補正",
  "新設事業已停止設置主要生產設備或經目的事業主管機關認定無繼續設廠（場）事實；事業停工（業）三個月以上；事業遷移或主要設備已搬遷經認定無繼續生產事實；改變生產製程致無廢水產生；經下水道管理機關通知拒絕納管自通知日起七日內仍未補正",
  "事業於申請日前一年內有違反本法情事經主管機關處分；事業經查獲繞流排放一次以上；事業之放流水任一項目超過放流水標準；事業未依規定辦理年度申報；事業未於期限內繳納水污染防治費或審查費用等五種情形之一者",
  "新設事業已取得工廠登記但尚未開始營運；事業停工（業）一個月以上；事業之負責人變更而未辦理登記事項變更；事業之專責人員離職逾三十日未補行設置；事業未依規定公開其水措計畫核准文件於資訊網路"],"a",
 "第47條：事業有下列情形之一者，主管機關得廢止其水措計畫核准文件──新設事業已停止設置主要生產設備或經目的事業主管機關認定無繼續設廠（場）事實；事業停工（業）一年以上，但有正當理由無法復工、復業報經目的事業主管機關核准者不在此限；事業遷移或主要生產、服務設備已搬遷，經目的事業主管機關或主管機關認定無繼續生產、製造、加工或服務之事實；事業改變生產製程致無廢水產生；經下水道管理機關（構）通知拒絕納入污水下水道系統，自通知日起一個月內仍未補正。",
 "On what grounds may the authority revoke an enterprise's approved control plan?",
 ["A new enterprise has stopped installing main production equipment or is found not to be continuing plant construction; shutdown for one year or more; relocation or removal of main equipment with no continuing production; a process change ending wastewater generation; or refusal of sewer connection uncorrected within one month of notice",
  "A new enterprise has stopped installing main production equipment or is found not to be continuing construction; shutdown for three months or more; relocation or removal of main equipment with no continuing production; a process change ending wastewater generation; or refusal of sewer connection uncorrected within seven days of notice",
  "The enterprise was penalized under the Act within the year before filing; it was caught bypassing discharge once or more; any effluent item exceeded the standards; it failed to file its annual report; or it failed to pay the water pollution control fee or review fee on time",
  "A new enterprise holds factory registration but has not begun operating; shutdown for one month or more; the responsible person changed without a registration change; dedicated personnel left for over 30 days without replacement; or the plan was not published online"],
 "Article 47."),

(WP,"第48條",3,"水措-廢止排放許可證",
 "主管機關得廢止事業或污水下水道系統排放許可證（文件）之情形為何？",
 ["依本法第十五條第二項規定者；有第四十七條第二款至第四款情形者；放流水排入專用雨水下水道、灌排使用渠道或私有水體經管理機關（構）或所有人異議終止，自異議之日起一個月內仍未補正者；經下水道管理機關（構）撤銷同意專管排放，自通知之日起一個月內仍未補正者",
  "依本法第十五條第二項規定者；有第四十七條第二款至第四款情形者；放流水排入專用雨水下水道、灌排使用渠道或私有水體經管理機關（構）或所有人異議終止，自異議之日起三個月內仍未補正者；經下水道管理機關（構）撤銷同意專管排放，自通知之日起六個月內仍未補正者",
  "依本法第七條規定加嚴放流水標準者；有第四十六條第一項第一款情形者；放流水排入專用雨水下水道、灌排使用渠道或私有水體經管理機關（構）或所有人異議終止，自異議之日起一個月內仍未補正者；經核發機關認定其功能不足而未於期限內完成改善者",
  "依本法第十五條第二項規定者；有第四十七條第一款及第五款情形者；放流水排入海洋放流管線經航政機關異議終止，自異議之日起一個月內仍未補正者；經下水道管理機關（構）撤銷同意專管排放，自通知之日起一個月內仍未補正者"],"a",
 "第48條第1項：事業或污水下水道系統有下列情形之一者，主管機關得廢止其排放許可證（文件）──依本法第15條第2項規定；有第47條第2款至第4款之情形（停工業一年以上、遷移或主要設備搬遷、改變製程致無廢水產生）；放流水排入專用雨水下水道、灌排使用渠道或私有水體，經管理機關（構）或所有人提出異議終止其放流水排入，自提出異議之日起一個月內仍未補正；經下水道管理機關（構）通知撤銷同意專管排放，自通知之日起一個月內仍未補正。第48條第2項：有第47條第2款至第4款之情形者，主管機關得廢止其貯留或稀釋許可文件。",
 "On what grounds may the authority revoke a discharge permit?",
 ["Under Article 15, paragraph 2 of the Act; where Article 47, subparagraphs 2 to 4 apply; where effluent entering a dedicated storm sewer, irrigation channel or private water body is objected to and terminated and not corrected within one month of the objection; or where consent for dedicated-pipe discharge is withdrawn and not corrected within one month of notice",
  "Under Article 15, paragraph 2; where Article 47, subparagraphs 2 to 4 apply; where effluent entering a dedicated storm sewer, irrigation channel or private water body is objected to and terminated and not corrected within three months of the objection; or where consent for dedicated-pipe discharge is withdrawn and not corrected within six months of notice",
  "Where effluent standards are tightened under Article 7; where Article 46, paragraph 1, subparagraph 1 applies; where such effluent entry is objected to and not corrected within one month; or where the facilities are found inadequate and not improved within the set period",
  "Under Article 15, paragraph 2; where Article 47, subparagraphs 1 and 5 apply; where ocean outfall discharge is objected to by the maritime authority and not corrected within one month; or where consent for dedicated-pipe discharge is withdrawn and not corrected within one month"],
 "Article 48."),

(WP,"第49條",3,"水措-新設事業補齊文件",
 "新設立且應先檢具水措計畫之事業，於未取得目的事業主管機關相關證明文件前先獲核准水措計畫者，應如何辦理？",
 ["納管事業且無排放於地面水體者，應於申請水措計畫核准文件之登記時補齊證明文件，或於取得證明文件後三十日內辦理變更；其他事業應於申請許可證（文件）時補齊相關證明文件；非以證明文件申請而先核發許可證（文件）者，應於取得登記證明文件後三十日內辦理變更",
  "納管事業且無排放於地面水體者，應於申請水措計畫核准文件之登記時補齊證明文件，或於取得證明文件後九十日內辦理變更；其他事業應於取得許可證（文件）後一年內補齊相關證明文件；非以證明文件申請而先核發許可證（文件）者，應於取得登記證明文件後六個月內辦理變更",
  "納管事業且無排放於地面水體者，應於水措計畫核准之日起三十日內補齊全部證明文件，逾期未補齊者其核准文件失其效力；其他事業應於申請許可證（文件）時補齊相關證明文件；非以證明文件申請而先核發許可證（文件）者，其許可證（文件）自始不生效力",
  "納管事業且無排放於地面水體者，得免補齊目的事業主管機關之相關證明文件；其他事業應於申請許可證（文件）時補齊相關證明文件；非以證明文件申請而先核發許可證（文件）者，應於取得登記證明文件後三十日內報請中央主管機關備查即可"],"a",
 "第49條第1項：新設立且應先檢具水措計畫之事業，於未取得目的事業主管機關之相關證明文件前，由核發機關先核准水措計畫者──納管事業且無排放廢（污）水於地面水體者，應於依第6條第3項規定申請水措計畫核准文件之登記時補齊相關證明文件，或於取得證明文件後三十日內辦理變更；前款以外之事業，應於申請許可證（文件）時補齊相關證明文件。第49條第2項：新設立之事業或污水下水道系統因目的事業主管機關定有設立許可、試車、會勘或登記之制度，非以證明文件申請許可證（文件），由核發機關先核發許可證（文件）者，應於取得該登記證明文件後三十日內辦理變更。",
 "For a newly established enterprise whose plan was approved before it obtained the industry authority's certificates:",
 ["A sewer-connected enterprise not discharging to surface water supplies the certificates when registering its approved plan, or files a change within 30 days of obtaining them; other enterprises supply them when applying for the permit; and where a permit issued without them, a change is filed within 30 days of obtaining the registration certificate",
  "A sewer-connected enterprise not discharging to surface water supplies the certificates when registering its approved plan, or files a change within 90 days of obtaining them; other enterprises supply them within one year after the permit issues; and where a permit issued without them, a change is filed within six months of obtaining the registration certificate",
  "A sewer-connected enterprise must supply all certificates within 30 days of plan approval or the approval lapses; other enterprises supply them when applying for the permit; and a permit issued without them is void from the outset",
  "A sewer-connected enterprise is exempt from supplying the industry authority's certificates; other enterprises supply them when applying for the permit; and where a permit issued without them, a filing with the central authority within 30 days suffices"],
 "Article 49."),

(WP,"第49-1條",2,"水措-污染流向示意圖",
 "事業或污水下水道系統辦理水措計畫或許可證（文件）之申請、變更或展延前，應先辦理何事項？",
 ["須先繪製全廠（場）空氣、水、廢棄物、毒性及關注化學物質污染流向示意圖，檢視污染在不同介質間之流向及在各類環保許可證（文件）間之關連；涉及其他類環保許可證（文件）者須同時提出申請、變更、異動或展延",
  "須先委託環境工程技師完成全廠（場）之環境風險評估報告書，檢視污染物對周界居民健康之影響及其與各類環保許可證（文件）間之關連；涉及其他類環保許可證（文件）者得於事後六個月內補行提出",
  "須先取得目的事業主管機關核發之工廠登記證及使用執照，檢視其核准產能與各類環保許可證（文件）所登記之處理量是否一致；涉及其他類環保許可證（文件）者由核發機關代為通知各該主管機關",
  "須先繪製全廠（場）之廢水收集及處理設施配置平面圖，檢視各處理單元之相對位置及其與放流口間之距離是否合理；涉及其他類環保許可證（文件）者，得由事業自行決定是否併同提出申請"],"a",
 "第49-1條第1項：事業或污水下水道系統辦理水措計畫或許可證（文件）之申請、變更或展延前，須先繪製全廠（場）空氣、水、廢棄物、毒性及關注化學物質污染流向示意圖，檢視污染在不同介質間之流向及在各類環保許可證（文件）間之關連。第49-1條第2項：有涉及其他類環保許可證（文件）之申請、變更、異動或展延者，須同時依各該環保法規規定提出，但可提出未實質涉及者不在此限。第49-1條第3項：經核發機關確認有涉及而未同時提出者，核發機關得續依本辦法規定審查，並通知應提出其他類環保許可證（文件）之申請、變更、異動或展延。",
 "Before applying for, changing or renewing a plan or permit, the enterprise must first:",
 ["Draw a plant-wide flow diagram of air, water, waste, toxic and concerned chemical pollution, reviewing flows across media and links among the environmental permits; and file simultaneously for any other environmental permits involved",
  "Commission an environmental engineer to complete a plant-wide risk assessment report, reviewing health effects on nearby residents and links among the environmental permits; other environmental permits may be filed within six months afterwards",
  "Obtain the industry authority's factory registration and use permit, reviewing whether approved capacity matches the volumes registered in the environmental permits; the issuing authority notifies the other authorities on its behalf",
  "Draw a plant-wide layout of wastewater collection and treatment facilities, reviewing unit positions and their distance to the outfall; whether to file for other environmental permits together is left to the enterprise"],
 "Article 49-1."),

(WP,"第50條",3,"水措-共同申請",
 "數事業共同採用同一水措方法，或採委託處理而涉及受託處理者資料變更時，應如何申請？受理機關不同時如何處理？",
 ["數事業或污水下水道系統共同採用同一水措方法者應共同申請；採委託處理者涉及受託處理者資料之變更時，委託者及受託者應共同申請之；受理機關不同時，由受託者之核發機關邀集委託者之核發機關參與審查",
  "數事業或污水下水道系統共同採用同一水措方法者應共同申請；採委託處理者涉及受託處理者資料之變更時，僅需由受託者單獨申請即可；受理機關不同時，由委託者之核發機關邀集受託者之核發機關參與審查",
  "數事業或污水下水道系統共同採用同一水措方法者應分別單獨申請；採委託處理者涉及受託處理者資料之變更時，委託者及受託者應共同申請之；受理機關不同時，應一律報請中央主管機關指定其中一機關審查",
  "數事業或污水下水道系統共同採用同一水措方法者應由用水量最大者代表申請；採委託處理者涉及受託處理者資料之變更時，得由任一方單獨申請；受理機關不同時，由二機關分別各自審查其管轄範圍內之事項"],"a",
 "第50條第1項：數事業或污水下水道系統共同採用同一水措方法者，應共同申請水措計畫、許可證（文件）。第50條第2項：事業或污水下水道系統採委託處理者，其申請、變更或展延涉及受託處理者資料之變更時，委託者及受託者應共同申請之。第50條第3項：前項受理機關不同時，由受託者之核發機關邀集委託者之核發機關參與審查。第50條第4項：採行二種以上水措方法者，應同時檢具各該水措方法之相關資料。",
 "How must joint users of one measure apply, and what if the receiving authorities differ?",
 ["Several enterprises using the same measure must apply jointly; where entrusted treatment involves a change in the contractor's data, the principal and the contractor apply jointly; and where the authorities differ, the contractor's authority invites the principal's authority to join the review",
  "Several enterprises using the same measure must apply jointly; where entrusted treatment involves a change in the contractor's data, the contractor alone applies for the change; and where the authorities differ, the principal's authority invites the contractor's authority to join the review",
  "Several enterprises using the same measure must each apply separately; where entrusted treatment involves a change in the contractor's data, both apply jointly; and where the authorities differ, the central authority designates one of them to review",
  "Several enterprises using the same measure apply through the one with the largest water use; where entrusted treatment involves such a change, either party may apply alone; and where the authorities differ, each reviews its own jurisdiction separately"],
 "Article 50."),

(WP,"第51條",2,"水措-委託代操作責任",
 "事業將部分廠（場）或設備供他人使用，或委託他人操作水污染防治設備者，其申請責任歸屬為何？",
 ["仍應由該事業或污水下水道系統負申請、變更、展延水措計畫或許可證（文件）之責任",
  "其申請、變更、展延水措計畫或許可證（文件）之責任應移轉予實際使用之他人",
  "供他人使用者仍負其責，但委託他人代操作者得免負申請、變更、展延之責任",
  "應由委託者與受託代操作者共同具名申請，並就其違規行為負連帶行政責任"],"a",
 "第51條：事業或污水下水道系統將其部分廠（場）或設備供他人使用，或委託他人操作水污染防治設備，仍應負申請、變更、展延水措計畫或許可證（文件）之責。此與土壤處理標準第24條之規定意旨相同，均由原事業負最終之申請與管理責任，不因委外操作而免除。",
 "Where part of a plant or equipment is used by others, or control equipment is operated under contract:",
 ["The enterprise or sewerage system remains responsible for applying for, changing and renewing the plan or permit",
  "Responsibility for applying for, changing and renewing the plan or permit passes to the party actually using it",
  "Responsibility remains where a plant is used by others, but is waived where operation is contracted out",
  "The principal and the contract operator must apply jointly and bear joint administrative liability for violations"],
 "Article 51."),

(WP,"第52條",1,"水措-併同申請",
 "事業或污水下水道系統申請許可證（文件）之審查、變更及展延，得與何種申請併同提出？",
 ["得與本法第三十二條規定之申請併同提出","得與本法第十四條之一規定之申請併同提出",
  "得與本法第六十三條規定之復工申請併同提出","應各自單獨提出而不得與其他申請併同辦理"],"a",
 "第52條：事業或污水下水道系統申請許可證（文件）之審查、變更及展延，得與本法第三十二條規定之申請，併同提出。本法第32條係關於廢（污）水注入地下水體或排放於土壤之規定，其子法即土壤處理標準；土壤處理標準第25條並定同時申請二者時審查費以單項最高金額計算。",
 "An application for review, change or renewal of a permit may be filed together with which application?",
 ["An application under Article 32 of the Act","An application under Article 14-1 of the Act",
  "A restart application under Article 63 of the Act","None; each must be filed separately on its own"],
 "Article 52 (see also Article 25 of the Soil Treatment Standards)."),

(WP,"第53條",1,"水措-換發補發",
 "水措計畫、許可證（文件）於有效期間內毀損或滅失者，應如何辦理？",
 ["應於事實發生後三十日內以書面敘明原因，向核發機關申請換發或補發",
  "應於事實發生後七日內以書面敘明原因，向中央主管機關申請換發補發",
  "應於事實發生後九十日內以口頭敘明原因，向核發機關報請備查即可",
  "應於事實發生後三十日內重新檢具全部申請文件，向核發機關重新申請"],"a",
 "第53條：水措計畫、許可證（文件）於有效期間內毀損或滅失者，應於事實發生後三十日內，以書面敘明原因，向核發機關申請換發或補發。此與土壤處理標準第26條之規定相同，均屬證件滅失之補救程序，與第20條至第27條之變更程序及第31條之展延程序有別。",
 "If a plan or permit is damaged or lost during its validity, the holder must:",
 ["Apply in writing to the issuing authority for reissue or replacement within 30 days of the event, stating the reason",
  "Apply in writing to the central competent authority for reissue or replacement within 7 days of the event",
  "Report the reason orally to the issuing authority for the record within 90 days of the event",
  "Submit all application documents again to the issuing authority within 30 days and reapply afresh"],
 "Article 53."),

(WP,"第54條",3,"水措-免申請變更情形",
 "下列何種情形，事業或污水下水道系統免依本辦法規定申請或變更水措計畫、許可證（文件）？",
 ["因天然災害或緊急事故依主管機關命令所採行之水措；自來水事業減少供水或停水期間以槽車補充用水且未超出原登記總用水量者；作業環境內土壤地下水污染整治所產生之水，不超過設計容量及登記每日最大核准量百分之十、超過放流水標準且處理設施有足夠功能，經審查同意納入處理者",
  "因天然災害或緊急事故依主管機關命令所採行之水措；自來水事業減少供水或停水期間以槽車補充用水而不論是否超出原登記總用水量者；作業環境內土壤地下水污染整治所產生之水，不超過設計容量及登記每日最大核准量百分之三十，經審查同意納入處理設施處理者",
  "因季節性生產調整或訂單增加所採行之臨時性水措；自來水事業減少供水或停水期間以槽車補充用水且未超出原登記總用水量者；作業環境內土壤地下水污染整治所產生之水，不超過設計容量及登記每日最大核准量百分之十，經審查同意納入處理設施處理者",
  "因天然災害或緊急事故依事業自行判斷所採行之水措；自來水事業減少供水期間以槽車補充用水且未超出原登記總用水量者；作業環境內土壤地下水污染整治所產生之水，未超過放流水標準且不超過登記每日最大核准量百分之五十者，均免申請或變更"],"a",
 "第54條第1項：事業或污水下水道系統因天然災害或緊急事故發生時，依主管機關之命令所採行之水措，免依本辦法規定申請或變更水措計畫、許可證（文件）。第54條第2項：自來水事業減少供水或輪流供水、停水期間，事業以槽車或其他方式補充其用水來源，且未超出原登記之總用水量時，免依本辦法規定變更。第54條第3項：於作業環境內因土壤、地下水污染整治所產生之水，符合不超過廢（污）水處理設施設計容量且不超過登記每日最大核准量百分之十、整治所產生之水超過放流水標準、處理設施有足夠功能處理其所含污染物等三款規定，且經主管機關依土壤及地下水污染整治法審查同意應納入處理者，免申請或變更。",
 "In which situations is an application or change exempted under these Regulations?",
 ["Measures ordered by the authority during a natural disaster or emergency; tanker-supplied water during reduced or suspended tap water supply not exceeding the registered total; and remediation water on site within design capacity and 10% of the registered maximum, exceeding effluent standards, with adequate treatment capacity, approved for treatment",
  "Measures ordered by the authority during a natural disaster or emergency; tanker-supplied water during reduced or suspended tap water supply whether or not it exceeds the registered total; and remediation water on site within design capacity and 30% of the registered maximum, exceeding effluent standards, with adequate treatment capacity, approved for treatment",
  "Temporary measures for seasonal production changes or increased orders; tanker-supplied water during reduced supply not exceeding the registered total; and remediation water on site within design capacity and 10% of the registered maximum, approved for treatment",
  "Measures adopted at the enterprise's own judgment during a disaster; tanker-supplied water during reduced supply not exceeding the registered total; and remediation water not exceeding the effluent standards and within 50% of the registered maximum"],
 "Article 54."),

(WP,"第55條",1,"水措-網路傳輸",
 "事業或污水下水道系統辦理水措計畫或許可證（文件）之申請、變更及展延，應以何種方式為之？",
 ["應採網路傳輸方式辦理；但經直轄市、縣（市）主管機關同意者，得以書面方式為之",
  "應採書面掛號方式辦理；但經直轄市、縣（市）主管機關同意者，得以網路傳輸為之",
  "應採網路傳輸方式辦理；且不論有無經主管機關同意，均不得以書面方式提出申請",
  "得由事業自行選擇採網路傳輸或書面方式辦理，主管機關不得對此設有任何限制"],"a",
 "第55條：事業或污水下水道系統應採網路傳輸方式辦理水措計畫或許可證（文件）之申請、變更及展延；但經直轄市、縣（市）主管機關同意者，得以書面方式為之。第28條第6項另定試驗計畫書應於中央主管機關指定之日起採網路傳輸方式辦理。",
 "How must applications, changes and renewals of plans and permits be filed?",
 ["By online transmission; paper filing is allowed only where the municipal or county authority consents",
  "By registered paper mail; online transmission is allowed only where the municipal or county authority consents",
  "By online transmission only, and paper filing is never permitted whether or not the authority consents",
  "By whichever of online or paper filing the enterprise chooses, with no restriction imposed by the authority"],
 "Article 55 (see also Article 28, paragraph 6)."),

(WP,"第56條",3,"水措-資訊公開與領證",
 "核准之水措計畫或許可證（文件），其資訊公開及領證程序之期限規定為何？",
 ["核發機關應將核准內容上傳於水污染源管制資料管理系統，並於核准後十四日內以書面掛號送達或作成電話紀錄方式通知；事業應於通知之日起十四日內將核准內容公開於中央主管機關指定之網站，並繳交證書費及領取許可證；確認公開及完成繳費後始得核發",
  "核發機關應將核准內容上傳於水污染源管制資料管理系統，並於核准後三十日內以書面掛號送達或作成電話紀錄方式通知；事業應於通知之日起三十日內將核准內容公開於中央主管機關指定之網站，並繳交證書費及領取許可證；確認公開及完成繳費後始得核發",
  "核發機關應將核准內容公告於政府公報，並於核准後十四日內以電子郵件方式通知；事業應於通知之日起十四日內將核准內容公開於其自設網站，並繳交證書費及領取許可證；核發機關得於事業完成公開前先行核發其許可證（文件）",
  "核發機關應將核准內容上傳於水污染源管制資料管理系統，並於核准後七日內以書面掛號送達通知；事業應於通知之日起七日內將核准內容公開於中央主管機關指定之網站，並繳交證書費及領取許可證；未公開者仍得先行領證後補行公開"],"a",
 "第56條第1項：檢具與後續補正之申請表及經核准之水措計畫核准文件、許可證（文件），應依中央主管機關規定公開之內容，隱匿個人資料後公開於中央主管機關指定之網站；未依規定公開者應通知限期補正，屆期未補正應駁回申請。第56條第2項：核發機關應將核准內容上傳於水污染源管制資料管理系統，並於核准後十四日內以書面掛號送達或作成電話紀錄方式通知事業應於通知之日起十四日內公開核准內容並繳交證書費及領證。第56條第3項：核發機關確認公開及完成繳費後始得核發，核發後應將許可證首頁公開。第56條第5項：通知領證日達一年始辦理領證者，應現場確認符合原核准事項後始得發證。",
 "What deadlines govern disclosure and collection of an approved plan or permit?",
 ["The authority uploads the approved content to the water pollution source control system and notifies by registered mail or a phone record within 14 days of approval; the enterprise publishes the content on the designated website and pays the fee to collect the permit within 14 days of notice; issuance follows confirmation of disclosure and payment",
  "The authority uploads the approved content to the water pollution source control system and notifies by registered mail or a phone record within 30 days of approval; the enterprise publishes the content on the designated website and pays the fee to collect the permit within 30 days of notice; issuance follows confirmation of disclosure and payment",
  "The authority publishes the content in the government gazette and notifies by email within 14 days of approval; the enterprise publishes it on its own website and pays the fee within 14 days; the permit may be issued before disclosure is completed",
  "The authority uploads the content and notifies by registered mail within 7 days of approval; the enterprise publishes it on the designated website and pays the fee within 7 days; the permit may be collected first and disclosure completed later"],
 "Article 56."),

(WP,"第57條",2,"水措-違規者加重公開",
 "事業於申請日前一年內有違反本法情事經主管機關處分者，應如何辦理資訊公開？其認定基準為何？",
 ["應另將檢具與後續補正檢附之文件一併公開於資訊網路；違反情事以主管機關開立裁處書之日或移送地方檢察署偵查之日認定，但提起行政救濟者以原處分確定之日認定",
  "應另將檢具與後續補正檢附之文件一併公開於資訊網路；違反情事以主管機關派員稽查之日或接獲民眾陳情之日認定，但提起行政救濟者以裁處書送達之日認定",
  "得免將檢具與後續補正檢附之文件公開於資訊網路，僅需公開核准文件即可；違反情事以主管機關開立裁處書之日認定，提起行政救濟者亦同而不受影響",
  "應另將檢具與後續補正檢附之文件一併公開於資訊網路；違反情事以罰鍰繳納完畢之日或改善完成經查驗合格之日認定，但提起行政救濟者以裁定駁回之日認定"],"a",
 "第57條第1項：事業或污水下水道系統依本辦法規定辦理水措計畫、許可證（文件）之申請、變更或展延，於申請日前一年內有違反本法情事經主管機關處分者，依第56條第1項規定辦理時，應另將檢具與後續補正檢附之文件公開於資訊網路。第57條第2項：前項違反本法情事經主管機關處分，以主管機關開立裁處書之日或移送地方檢察署偵查之日認定之；但提起行政救濟者，以原處分確定之日認定之。第62條並定第57條自發布日施行。",
 "If penalized under the Act within the year before filing, what extra disclosure applies and how is the date determined?",
 ["The submitted and subsequently corrected documents must also be published online; the violation date is the date the penalty notice was issued or the case referred to the district prosecutor, or, if administrative remedies are sought, the date the original disposition becomes final",
  "The submitted and subsequently corrected documents must also be published online; the violation date is the date of the on-site inspection or the date on which a public complaint was received, or, if administrative remedies are sought, the date the penalty notice was served",
  "The submitted and corrected documents need not be published, only the approved document; the violation date is the date the penalty notice was issued, and administrative remedies make no difference",
  "The submitted and corrected documents must also be published online; the violation date is the date the fine was paid or improvements passed inspection, or, if remedies are sought, the date the appeal was dismissed"],
 "Article 57 (effective from the promulgation date under Article 62)."),

(WP,"第58條",2,"水措-舊案復工公開",
 "一百零五年一月十九日修正施行前已受理復工（業）改善計畫但尚未完成准駁者，應如何辦理？",
 ["應於完成審查之日起二十日內，將審查會議紀錄及經核定之水污染防治措施及污泥處理改善計畫，於隱匿個人資料後公開登載於中央主管機關指定之網頁",
  "應於完成審查之日起六十日內，將審查會議紀錄及經核定之水污染防治措施及污泥處理改善計畫，於隱匿個人資料後公開登載於中央主管機關指定之網頁",
  "應於受理申請之日起二十日內，將申請書及水污染防治措施及污泥處理改善計畫全文未經隱匿逕行公開登載於該事業自設之資訊網站供各界查閱",
  "應於完成審查之日起二十日內，將審查會議紀錄及經核定之改善計畫函送目的事業主管機關備查即可，無須公開登載於任何資訊網路或網頁"],"a",
 "第58條第1項：直轄市、縣（市）主管機關於本辦法中華民國一百零五年一月十九日修正施行前，已受理依本法第63條第1項規定申請復工（業）者提出之水污染防治措施及污泥處理改善計畫，但尚未完成復工（業）准駁者，應於完成審查之日起二十日內，將審查會議紀錄及經核定之水污染防治措施及污泥處理改善計畫，公開登載於中央主管機關指定之網頁。第58條第2項：前項經核定之計畫，直轄市、縣（市）主管機關應隱匿個人資料後公開。此與第34條第5項之公開期限一致。",
 "For restart improvement plans accepted before the 19 January 2016 amendment but not yet decided, the authority must:",
 ["Publish the review meeting minutes and the approved control and sludge improvement plan on the designated website with personal data redacted, within 20 days of completing the review",
  "Publish the review meeting minutes and the approved control and sludge improvement plan on the designated website with personal data redacted, within 60 days of completing the review",
  "Publish the application and the full unredacted improvement plan on the enterprise's own website for public inspection, within 20 days of accepting the application",
  "Send the review meeting minutes and the approved plan to the industry competent authority for the record within 20 days, with no online publication required at all"],
 "Article 58 (compare Article 34, paragraph 5)."),

(WP,"第59條",3,"水措-保密與工商機密",
 "水措資料涉及保密者之處理原則，以及申請工商機密保密應符合之要件為何？",
 ["已依新化學物質及既有化學物質資料登錄辦法申請保密且經核准者不予公開；涉及工商機密者應提出非一般涉及該類資訊之人所知、因其秘密性而具有實際或潛在之經濟價值、所有人已採取合理之保密措施等三要件之證明文件，向直轄市、縣（市）主管機關申請保密經核准後得隱匿不公開",
  "已依新化學物質及既有化學物質資料登錄辦法申請保密且經核准者不予公開；涉及工商機密者應提出經會計師簽證之營業損失評估報告、同業競爭分析報告及董事會決議紀錄等三項文件，向中央主管機關申請保密經核准後得隱匿不公開其相關資料及書面文件而免公開於資訊網路",
  "凡事業主張涉及營業秘密之資料一律不予公開而無須另行申請核准；涉及工商機密者僅需以書面敘明理由通知核發機關，並由核發機關逕行認定是否隱匿，事業無須提出任何證明文件或符合特定之要件",
  "已依新化學物質及既有化學物質資料登錄辦法申請保密且經核准者仍應公開；涉及工商機密者應提出非一般涉及該類資訊之人所知、具有實際或潛在之經濟價值、所有人已採取合理保密措施等三要件證明，向目的事業主管機關申請保密經核准後得隱匿"],"a",
 "第59條第1項：申請水措計畫或許可證（文件）審查時，依附表三及附表四檢具之依規定應揭露之排放廢（污）水污染物之水措資料及其相關書面文件，已依新化學物質及既有化學物質資料登錄辦法向中央主管機關申請保密且經核准者，不予公開。第59條第2項：所稱個人資料包括姓名、身分證或護照字號、個人照片、出生日期、聯絡電話、行動電話、傳真電話、電子郵件、戶籍所在地址或其他得以直接或間接方式識別該個人之資料。第59條第3項：應公開之資料及文件涉及工商機密者，於提出非一般涉及該類資訊之人所知、因其秘密性而具有實際或潛在之經濟價值、所有人已採取合理之保密措施等三要件之證明文件，向直轄市、縣（市）主管機關申請保密並經核准後，得隱匿不公開。",
 "How is confidential information handled, and what must a trade secret confidentiality request show?",
 ["Data already approved as confidential under the chemical substance registration regulations is not published; trade secret claims require proof that the information is not generally known to persons dealing with it, has actual or potential economic value from its secrecy, and has been subject to reasonable protection measures, approved by the municipal or county authority",
  "Data already approved as confidential under those regulations is not published; trade secret claims require a CPA-certified business loss assessment report, a competitive industry analysis report and board meeting minutes, submitted to the central competent authority for approval before any of the information may be redacted and withheld from publication on the website",
  "Any data the enterprise claims as a trade secret is withheld without any approval process; the enterprise need only state its reasons in writing to the issuing authority, which decides on redaction without any supporting proof or criteria",
  "Data approved as confidential under those regulations must still be published; trade secret claims require proof that it is not generally known, has economic value and has been reasonably protected, approved by the industry competent authority before redaction"],
 "Article 59."),

(WP,"第60條",2,"水措-畜牧糞尿資源化",
 "經地方政府補助設置畜牧糞尿資源化設備處理其他畜牧場糞尿之事業，其許可證（文件）申請、變更應如何辦理？",
 ["其相關規定應依中央主管機關補助地方政府之計畫辦理；直轄市、縣（市）主管機關於竣工查驗通過後，應將計畫內容納入許可證（文件）登記，並通知事業確認登記事項後核准或換發，並依第五十六條規定隱匿個人資料後公開於指定網站",
  "其相關規定應依中央主管機關補助地方政府之計畫辦理；直轄市、縣（市）主管機關於補助款核撥後，應將計畫內容納入許可證（文件）登記，並通知事業確認登記事項後核准或換發，惟該登記內容涉及補助事項者得免公開於指定網站",
  "其相關規定應依農業主管機關所定之再利用管理辦法辦理；直轄市、縣（市）主管機關於竣工查驗通過後，應將計畫內容函送中央主管機關核定後始得納入許可證（文件）登記，並由中央主管機關逕行公開於其指定之網站",
  "其相關規定應依事業與地方政府所簽訂之補助契約辦理；直轄市、縣（市）主管機關於竣工查驗通過後，得由事業自行決定是否將計畫內容納入許可證（文件）登記，並免經確認程序即核准或換發其許可證（文件）"],"a",
 "第60條第1項：經地方政府補助設置畜牧糞尿資源化設備處理其他畜牧場畜牧糞尿之事業，或委託上述事業處理畜牧糞尿之其他畜牧業，其許可證（文件）申請、變更之相關規定，應依中央主管機關補助地方政府之計畫辦理。第60條第2項：直轄市、縣（市）主管機關依前項計畫之規定，於竣工查驗通過後，應將畜牧糞尿資源化設備處理其他畜牧場畜牧糞尿計畫內容納入許可證（文件）登記，並通知事業確認登記事項後，核准或換發其許可證（文件），及依第56條第1項及第2項規定隱匿個人資料後公開於中央主管機關指定之網站，完成許可證（文件）領證。",
 "For enterprises subsidized to install livestock manure resource facilities, how are permit applications handled?",
 ["The rules follow the central authority's subsidy program for local governments; after passing the completion inspection the local authority registers the program content in the permit, notifies the enterprise to confirm the entries, then approves or reissues it and publishes it with personal data redacted under Article 56",
  "The rules follow the central authority's subsidy program; after the subsidy is disbursed the local authority registers the program content in the permit and notifies the enterprise to confirm the registered entries, but entries relating to the subsidy itself need not be published on the designated website at all",
  "The rules follow the agricultural authority's reuse management regulations; after the completion inspection the local authority sends the content to the central authority for approval before registration, and the central authority publishes it on its designated website",
  "The rules follow the subsidy contract between the enterprise and the local government; after the completion inspection the enterprise decides whether to have the content registered, and the permit is approved or reissued without any confirmation step"],
 "Article 60."),

(WP,"第61條",2,"水措-新增事業期限",
 "水污染防治法事業分類及定義公告新增之事業，應於何時取得水措計畫核准文件或許可證（文件）？",
 ["應於公告施行日起一年內取得水措計畫核准文件或許可證（文件）核准文件",
  "應於公告施行日起三年內取得水措計畫核准文件或許可證（文件）核准文件",
  "應於公告施行日起六個月內取得水措計畫核准文件或許可證（文件）核准文件",
  "應於公告施行日起三十日內提出申請並於受理後即視為已取得核准文件"],"a",
 "第61條：水污染防治法事業分類及定義公告新增之事業，應於公告施行日起一年內取得水措計畫核准文件或許可證（文件）核准文件。此與土壤處理標準第30條就九十四年十二月六日公告新納入事業所定之過渡期限，同屬新納管對象之緩衝規定。",
 "Newly listed enterprises under an announcement of industry categories must obtain the approved plan or permit by when?",
 ["Within one year from the effective date of the announcement","Within three years from the effective date of the announcement",
  "Within six months from the effective date of the announcement","Within 30 days of the announcement, deemed approved on filing"],
 "Article 61 (compare Article 30 of the Soil Treatment Standards)."),

(WP,"第62條",2,"水措-施行日",
 "本辦法之施行日期規定為何？一百十五年三月二十四日修正發布之條文如何施行？",
 ["本辦法自發布日施行；一百十五年三月二十四日修正發布之條文，除第五十七條自發布日施行外，自一百十五年十月一日施行",
  "本辦法自發布日施行；一百十五年三月二十四日修正發布之條文，除第五十六條自發布日施行外，自一百十六年一月一日施行",
  "本辦法自發布日施行；一百十五年三月二十四日修正發布之條文一律自發布日施行，並無另定施行日期之特別規定存在",
  "本辦法自發布後六個月施行；一百十五年三月二十四日修正發布之條文，除第五十七條自發布日施行外，自一百十五年七月一日施行"],"a",
 "第62條：本辦法自發布日施行；本辦法中華民國一百十五年三月二十四日修正發布之條文，除第五十七條自發布日施行外，自一百十五年十月一日施行。第57條係關於申請日前一年內有違反本法情事經處分者應加重公開檢具文件之規定，故提前自發布日生效。",
 "What is the effective date rule, and how do the amendments of 24 March 2026 take effect?",
 ["The Regulations take effect on promulgation; the amendments take effect on 1 October 2026, except Article 57 which takes effect on the promulgation date",
  "The Regulations take effect on promulgation; the amendments take effect on 1 January 2027, except Article 56 which takes effect on the promulgation date",
  "The Regulations take effect on promulgation; all of the amendments take effect on the promulgation date, with no separate effective date set at all",
  "The Regulations take effect six months after promulgation; the amendments take effect on 1 July 2026, except Article 57 which takes effect on promulgation"],
 "Article 62."),
]
